-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Craftsman Universal Agentic Engineering Framework — Scope & Attribution Notice
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This license covers all files in the Craftsman repository, including:
1. Multi-platform orchestration & export scripts (`scripts/craftsman-stop-gate.py`,
   `scripts/craftsman-scope-guard.py`, `scripts/copilot-export.py`, and `install.sh`).
2. Deterministic lifecycle hook definitions (`hooks.json`).
3. Global engineering rules (`rules/ultra_mode.md`) and all
   17 core software engineering skill specifications (`skills/*/SKILL.md`).
4. Behavioral and integration test suites (`tests/test_hooks.py`).

All prompt templates, state-machine scripts, and architectural specifications in this
repository are original implementations authored for the Craftsman framework, combining
curated open-ecosystem engineering workflow patterns with an invocation-steerable
3-Gear Hybrid Hard-Loop state machine and deterministic Git lifecycle guardrails.
